  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">EasyJug, the hands-free hydration system for breastfeeding moms.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We created EasyJug to help new moms hydrate in comfort and convenice.&nbsp; There are many factors that make it difficult for new moms to drink enough water postpartum:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Sitting up to drink water after childbirth can feel uncomfortable and painful</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Moms arms are always full holding baby so it's difficult to find a free hand to drink water</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">The release of oxytocin leaves mom thirsty all the time.&nbsp; However, large water bottles are too bulky to hold over a nursing baby's head.&nbsp; Smaller bottles mean constant refills.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Breastmilk is 80-90% water.&nbsp; When moms don't drink water, their bodies will make sure to still produce enough breastmilk for baby but at the expense of mama's health. If mom doesn't have proper hydration she may experience symptoms like fatigue, constipation, headaches, bodyaches, and even depression.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">EasyJug is a 2.2 liter BPA free water bottle with a 47in long straw.&nbsp; The innovative design allows moms to hydrate in any breastfeeding position, even lying down.&nbsp; The large water bottle means less refills!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Join our movement to help mamas stay healthy and hydrated!</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Our affiliates make 10% commision on every sale and their customers receive a 10% discount code.&nbsp; Commissions are paid out after 60 days.&nbsp; This ensures that sale was processed and no return was made.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
